{
  "title": "Tsuihousareru Tabi ni Skill wo Te ni Ireta Ore ga, 100 no Isekai de 2-shuume Musou  (I Got a New Skill Every Time I was Exiled, and After 100 Different Worlds, I was Unmatched)",
  "description": "Ed, an adventurer exiled from 100 hero parties across 100 worlds, gained a powerful “Exiled Skill” each time he was thrown out. At the end of his journey, he finally earns the right to return home. But when offered a chance to witness the fate of the very first world he was banished from, he’s shocked to find it far from the peaceful place he expected. Now, he vows to revisit all 100 worlds, use his powers, and give each one a happy ending!\n\n\n\n\nFor updates and discussion, join our cult, I mean, discord server here- https://discord.gg/ts6wrSAuRM",
